  "description": "Welcome to the world of eFully adventures! Our new HAIBIKE ALLTRAIL 4 bridges the gap between hardtail and full-suspension trail bike – perfect for anyone seeking comfort without going full enduro. With 130mm travel front and rear, the SR Suntour suspension offers just the right amount of control and riding fun. The sturdy aluminium frame carries loads up to 150kg and performs well even with luggage. The latest Bosch Performance Line CX motor and 600Wh battery provide powerful, lasting support for your tours. The mullet wheel setup – 29\" front, 27.5\" rear – delivers smoothness and agility in one. A dropper post and reliable four-piston disc brakes complete the package. In short: the ALLTRAIL 4 is your entry into the eFully world – comfortable and ready for any trail adventure, big or small.",
